sensor-dht11 (2.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rewritten in C for reduced dependencies and faster startup
  * Removed Python runtime dependency
  * Native GPIO access via /dev/gpiomem
  * Same JSON output format as Python version
  * Added internal/external location filter arguments
  * Added bash completions

